    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1754879289\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1754879289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1754879289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/6150876646c833da67e14991220dcf6a.webp?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=60 /></span>Jisr Village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A village based in mountains and surrounded by rich nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers are close, agriculture is blooming, and all villagers here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are living their best lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But since the country implemented peremptory policies, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the villagers' lives became tough. Seeing this Unrighteous, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the traveler \u201cWagners,\u201d who has received the villagers' kindness, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decided to stand up against the government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the military of this country is all \u201cwomen\u201d...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/d0a591fdffe16f868a3a03548aac9599.avif?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/ad1f874c7b4f10994350517ba5625799.webp?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=60 /></span>This is a stage-based RPG action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat and captivate female soldiers in each stage to watch </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H events and progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell the soldiers to whorehouse to get some money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or throw them to your self-established ranch to collect items and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >further unlock H events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/71f04961ee50f4a79cfec43f57c70b75.avif?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/7437fccfe0e651a57594ac949908b15d.webp?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=60 /></span>Attack the female soldiers with a sword to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you touch the enemies, you will take damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist's HP is depleted, the defeated scene of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >being humiliated by the enemies will play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(To trigger the defeated scene easily, there are poisonous swamps everywhere, use them to your advantage.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897180/extras/0a1173ce1405b1442ee5c72d9d6f2db2.avif?t=1754879289\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
